# IntermediateDirectory ending in /. dumps every object flat into that directory,
# ignoring the source's relative path. Regression: the compiler flattened but the
# linker still looked for sub/util's object under Intermediate/sub/ (never created)
# and failed with "no such file or directory". Linking must use the flat path too.
Assembly              FlatObjApp
IntermediateDirectory Intermediate/.
SourceFiles           main sub/util
